Build out calculator funtions


CL_CLRS: clear stack
CL_CLRX: clear x register
CL_XxY: swap x and y registers
CL_BKS: backspace operation

CL_PLUS: addition operation
CL_MINS: subtraction operation
CL_DIV: division operation
CL_MULT: multiplication operation
CL_INV: inverse operation

CL_SIN: sin trigonometric function
CL_ASIN: arcsin inverse trigonometric function
CL_COS: cosine trigonometric function
CL_ACOS: arccosine inverse trigonometric function
CL_TAN: tangent trigonometric function
CL_ATAN: arctangent inverse trigonometric function
CL_LN: natural logarithm function
CL_POW: power function
CL_PI: pi constant
CL_EF: e constant
CL_LOG: base 10 logarithm function
CL_SQRT: square root function
CL_ABS: absolute value function
CL_INV: inverse function
CL_SQ: square function
CL_XtY: x to the power of y function

CL_1   : push 1 to stack
CL_2   : push 2 to stack
CL_3   : push 3 to stack
CL_4   : push 4 to stack
CL_5   : push 5 to stack
CL_6   : push 6 to stack
CL_7   : push 7 to stack
CL_8   : push 8 to stack
CL_9   : push 9 to stack
CL_0   : push 0 to stack

CL_DOT : decimal point operation
CL_ENT : enter operation
CL_OUT : output operation

